{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you like the turns? Like the high speed maneuvers in Spa or Glen? FP Racer is all about the turns. It's the feeling of control at a God-like level. <br><br>Immerse yourself in the world of FP Racer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524110/extras/ezgif-64a756e0b4d710.gif?t=1741070674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FP Racer is a short solo racing experience. It has 9 levels. There is a leaderboard for each level. <br>It is like a runner with car handling controls. There is no AI or competitive element except for the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It has a minimalistic design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524110/extras/s.png?t=1741070674\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3524110?t=1741070674","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3524110?t=1741070674","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524110/ee1a3034d62ab19e8a629f61238bd27c0e5cb20c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741070674","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524110/ee1a3034d62ab19e8a629f61238bd27c0e5cb20c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741070674","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you like the turns? Like the high speed maneuvers in Spa or Glen? FP Racer is all about the turns. It's the feeling of control at a God-like level. <br><br>Immerse yourself in the world of FP Racer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\